msgid "Storage"
msgstr "Úložisko"

msgctxt "#30406"
msgid "no Premium — playback will not work"
msgstr "bez Premium — prehrávanie nepôjde"

msgctxt "#30407"
msgid "Check for add-on updates"
msgstr "Skontrolovať aktualizácie doplnkov"

msgctxt "#30408"
msgid "Checking for add-on updates…"
msgstr "Kontrolujem aktualizácie doplnkov…"

msgctxt "#30409"
msgid "Add Nokturno to TMDb Helper (Play on movie details)"
msgstr "Pridať Nokturno do TMDb Helpera (Prehrať v detaile filmu)"

msgctxt "#30410"
msgid "TMDb Helper is not installed"
msgstr "TMDb Helper nie je nainštalovaný"

msgctxt "#30411"
msgid "Set Nokturno as the default player in TMDb Helper? Play on a movie or episode details page will then search streams in Nokturno."
msgstr "Nastaviť Nokturno ako predvolený prehrávač v TMDb Helperi? Prehrať v detaile filmu alebo dielu potom rovno hľadá streamy v Nokturne."

msgctxt "#30412"
msgid "Nokturno added to TMDb Helper"
msgstr "Nokturno je v TMDb Helperi"

msgctxt "#30413"
msgid "Adding to TMDb Helper failed"
msgstr "Pridanie do TMDb Helpera zlyhalo"

msgctxt "#30415"
msgid "Play from movie details"
msgstr "Prehrať z detailu filmu"

msgctxt "#30416"
msgid "You have TMDb Helper (movie details in Arctic Fuse and other skins).[CR]Set Nokturno as its player? The Play button on the details page will then search streams in Nokturno."
msgstr "Máš doplnok TMDb Helper (detail filmu v Arctic Fuse a ďalších skinoch).[CR]Nastaviť Nokturno ako jeho prehrávač? Tlačidlo Prehrať v detaile potom hľadá streamy v Nokturne."

msgctxt "#30417"
msgid "FastShare"
msgstr "FastShare"

msgctxt "#30418"
msgid "Search FastShare for titles"
msgstr "U titulov hľadať aj na FastShare"

msgctxt "#30419"
msgid "FastShare.cz is a Czech file host. Search works without an account; playback needs one and is charged from your credit unless you have unlimited downloads."
msgstr "FastShare.cz je česká úschovňa súborov. Hľadá sa aj bez účtu, na prehratie je potrebný účet — súbor sa odpočíta z kreditu, ak nemáš neobmedzené sťahovanie."

msgctxt "#30420"
msgid "FastShare — username"
msgstr "FastShare — používateľ"

msgctxt "#30421"
msgid "Name you use to sign in to fastshare.cz."
msgstr "Meno, ktorým sa prihlasuješ na fastshare.cz."

msgctxt "#30422"
msgid "FastShare — password"
msgstr "FastShare — heslo"

msgctxt "#30423"
msgid "Password for fastshare.cz. It is sent only when signing in; playback then uses a cookie."
msgstr "Heslo z fastshare.cz. Posiela sa len pri prihlásení, prehrávanie potom ide s cookie."

msgctxt "#30424"
msgid "Do you have a FastShare account?[CR]Search works without it, playback is charged from your credit or unlimited plan."
msgstr "Máš účet FastShare?[CR]Hľadá sa aj bez neho, prehratie ide z tvojho kreditu alebo neobmedzeného paušálu."

msgctxt "#30425"
msgid "unlimited downloads"
msgstr "neobmedzené sťahovanie"

msgctxt "#30426"
msgid "credit"
msgstr "kredit"

msgctxt "#30427"
msgid "Send Kodi log"
msgstr "Odoslať log Kodi"

msgctxt "#30428"
msgid "Sends the last ~500 KB of kodi.log to the same server as statistics, so the reported problem can be diagnosed. Nothing else leaves the device."
msgstr "Odošle posledných ~500 KB súboru kodi.log na rovnaký server ako štatistiky, aby sa dal nahlásený problém rozlúštiť. Nič ďalšie zariadenie neopúšťa."

msgctxt "#30429"
msgid "Log sent"
msgstr "Log odoslaný"

msgctxt "#30430"
msgid "Log could not be sent"
msgstr "Log sa nepodarilo odoslať"

msgctxt "#30431"
msgid "Really send the log?"
msgstr "Naozaj odoslať log?"

msgctxt "#30432"
msgid "Info"
msgstr "Info"



msgctxt "#30435"
msgid "This list is normally built in the background, but the data isn't ready yet. Checking dubbing/subtitles across the enabled sources can take a few minutes…"
msgstr "Tento zoznam sa štandardne zostavuje na pozadí, dáta ale zatiaľ nie sú pripravené. Zisťovanie dabingu a titulkov naprieč zapnutými zdrojmi môže trvať pár minút…"

msgctxt "#30436"
msgid "The list is being built in the background right now…"
msgstr "Zoznam sa práve zostavuje na pozadí…"

msgctxt "#30437"
msgid "Data aren't ready — checking dubbing/subtitles across the enabled sources can take a few minutes. Tap to start."
msgstr "Dáta nie sú pripravené — zistenie dabingu a titulkov naprieč zapnutými zdrojmi môže trvať pár minút. Ťuknutím spustíš."

msgctxt "#30438"
msgid "Started in the background — you'll get a notification when it's ready."
msgstr "Spustené na pozadí — až to bude hotové, príde upozornenie."

msgctxt "#30439"
msgid "Newly added with CZ dubbing/subtitles (%s) is ready"
msgstr "Novo pridané s CZ dabingom/titulkami (%s) je pripravené"

msgctxt "#30440"
msgid "Switch audio to the preferred language automatically"
msgstr "Automaticky prepnúť zvuk na preferovaný jazyk"

msgctxt "#30441"
msgid "When playback starts, the audio track in the preferred language is selected, even if the file has a different default track (often English in re-muxed movies)."
msgstr "Po spustení prehrávania sa vyberie zvuková stopa v preferovanom jazyku, aj keď má súbor ako predvolenú inú (pri prebalených filmoch často anglickú)."

msgctxt "#30442"
msgid "Subtitles"
msgstr "Titulky"

msgctxt "#30443"
msgid "Leave to Kodi"
msgstr "Nechať na Kodi"

msgctxt "#30444"
msgid "When audio in the preferred language is missing"
msgstr "Keď chýba zvuk v preferovanom jazyku"

msgctxt "#30445"
msgid "Always in the preferred language"
msgstr "Vždy v preferovanom jazyku"

msgctxt "#30446"
msgid "Subtitles in the preferred language (or a close one: Czech and Slovak substitute for each other) are turned on when the audio isn't in that language. When the audio is in the preferred language, subtitles are turned off, forced ones included. Subtitles from the source are downloaded and their language is recognised from the text."
msgstr "Titulky v preferovanom jazyku (alebo blízkom, čeština a slovenčina sa zastúpia) sa zapnú, keď zvuk v tom jazyku nie je. Keď zvuk v preferovanom jazyku je, titulky sa vypnú, aj vynútené. Titulky zo zdroja sa stiahnu a ich jazyk sa rozpozná z textu."

msgctxt "#30447"
msgid "Set up from phone"
msgstr "Nastaviť z mobilu"

msgctxt "#30448"
msgid "Shows a QR code on the TV. Open it on a phone connected to the same Wi-Fi and fill in the settings in the browser — no typing passwords with the remote. Works only on the local network."
msgstr "Na TV sa zobrazí QR kód. Otvor ho mobilom pripojeným k tej istej Wi-Fi a vyplň nastavenia v prehliadači — bez písania hesiel ovládačom. Funguje len v miestnej sieti."

msgctxt "#30449"
msgid "You can fill in accounts and sources on your phone — the TV shows a QR code, the phone just needs the same Wi-Fi and you don't type passwords with the remote. Or go through a short wizard with the remote.[CR]You can skip this and fill it in later in the add-on settings."
msgstr "Účty a zdroje môžeš vyplniť v mobile — na TV sa zobrazí QR kód, stačí mobil v tej istej Wi-Fi a heslá nepíšeš ovládačom. Alebo prejdi krátkeho sprievodcu ovládačom.[CR]Kedykoľvek to môžeš preskočiť a doplniť neskôr v Nastaveniach doplnku."

msgctxt "#30450"
msgid "From phone"
msgstr "Z mobilu"

msgctxt "#30451"
msgid "Wizard with remote"
msgstr "Sprievodca ovládačom"

msgctxt "#30452"
msgid "1. Connect your phone to the same Wi-Fi as this device.[CR]2. Scan the QR code with the camera, or open this address in a browser:"
msgstr "1. Pripoj mobil k tej istej Wi-Fi ako toto zariadenie.[CR]2. Naskenuj QR kód fotoaparátom, alebo otvor v prehliadači adresu:"

msgctxt "#30453"
msgid "Back cancels · the address is valid for 30 minutes and one save"
msgstr "Späť zruší · adresa platí 30 minút a pre jedno uloženie"

msgctxt "#30454"
msgid "This device has no local network address. Connect it to Wi-Fi or a cable and try again."
msgstr "Toto zariadenie nemá adresu v miestnej sieti. Pripoj ho k Wi-Fi alebo káblom a skús to znova."

msgctxt "#30455"
msgid "Couldn't start setup from phone (%s)."
msgstr "Nastavenie z mobilu sa nepodarilo spustiť (%s)."

msgctxt "#30456"
msgid "Settings from phone saved (%s)"
msgstr "Nastavenia z mobilu uložené (%s)"

msgctxt "#30457"
msgid "No changes came from the phone"
msgstr "Z mobilu neprišla žiadna zmena"

msgctxt "#30458"
msgid "Fill in what you want to change and save. The settings go straight to Kodi."
msgstr "Vyplň, čo chceš zmeniť, a ulož. Nastavenia sa hneď prepíšu do Kodi."

msgctxt "#30459"
msgid "Save to Kodi"
msgstr "Uložiť do Kodi"

msgctxt "#30460"
msgid "Saved. The settings are in Kodi, you can close this page."
msgstr "Uložené. Nastavenia sú v Kodi, stránku môžeš zavrieť."

msgctxt "#30461"
msgid "filled in — leave empty to keep the current value"
msgstr "vyplnené — prázdne pole ponechá pôvodnú hodnotu"

msgctxt "#30462"
msgid "This address is no longer valid. Start Set up from phone on the TV again."
msgstr "Táto adresa už neplatí. Na TV spusti Nastaviť z mobilu znova."

msgctxt "#30463"
msgid "Invalid value: %s"
msgstr "Neplatná hodnota: %s"

msgctxt "#30480"
msgid "Send error reports"
msgstr "Posielať hlásenia o chybách"

msgctxt "#30481"
msgid "When an error in the add-on's code happens, a short report goes to the author: error type, place in the code, version and a few lines of the Nokturno log. Addresses, accounts, passwords and IPs are removed first. Source outages are not sent. The same error is sent at most once per version."
msgstr "Keď v doplnku nastane chyba v kóde, pošle sa autorovi krátke hlásenie: typ chyby, miesto v kóde, verzia a pár riadkov logu Nokturna. Adresy, účty, heslá a IP sa vopred vymažú. Výpadky zdrojov sa neposielajú. Rovnaká chyba odíde najviac raz za verziu."

msgctxt "#30482"
msgid "Similar titles"
msgstr "Podobné tituly"

msgctxt "#30483"
msgid "TV guide"
msgstr "TV program"

msgctxt "#30484"
msgid "Day"
msgstr "Deň"

msgctxt "#30485"
msgid "Channel"
msgstr "Stanica"

msgctxt "#30486"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Typ"

msgctxt "#30487"
msgid "All channels"
msgstr "Všetky stanice"

msgctxt "#30488"
msgid "Movies and series"
msgstr "Filmy aj seriály"

msgctxt "#30489"
msgid "Today"
msgstr "Dnes"

msgctxt "#30490"
msgid "Tomorrow"
msgstr "Zajtra"

msgctxt "#30491"
msgid "Mon,Tue,Wed,Thu,Fri,Sat,Sun"
msgstr "po,ut,st,št,pi,so,ne"

msgctxt "#30492"
msgid "TV guide is not available right now"
msgstr "TV program teraz nie je dostupný"

msgctxt "#30493"
msgid "No similar titles found"
msgstr "Žiadne podobné tituly"

msgctxt "#30494"
msgid "No programmes in this selection"
msgstr "V tomto výbere nie sú žiadne relácie"

msgctxt "#30495"
msgid "What to show for a stream and in which order"
msgstr "Čo a v akom poradí ukazovať pri streame"

msgctxt "#30496"
msgid "Items separated by commas, the vertical bar splits the top and bottom line of the stream dialog. Whatever is missing is not shown. Items: langs (audio languages), size, video (resolution and codec), audio (audio tracks), bitrate, length, subs (subtitles), source, file (file name). Quality is always the picture on the left. Easier with Set up from phone."
msgstr "Položky oddelené čiarkou, zvislá čiara delí horný a dolný riadok dialógu výberu streamu. Čo chýba, sa nezobrazí. Položky: langs (jazyky zvuku), size (veľkosť), video (rozlíšenie a kodek), audio (zvukové stopy), bitrate (dátový tok), length (dĺžka), subs (titulky), source (zdroj), file (názov súboru). Kvalita je vždy obrázok vľavo. Pohodlnejšie cez Nastaviť z mobilu."

msgctxt "#30497"
msgid "Default order"
msgstr "Predvolené poradie"

msgctxt "#30498"
msgid "Puts back the default items and order. Reopen settings to see the new value."
msgstr "Vráti predvolené položky a poradie. Nová hodnota sa zobrazí po opätovnom otvorení nastavení."

msgctxt "#30499"
msgid "Top line|Bottom line"
msgstr "Horný riadok|Dolný riadok"

msgctxt "#30500"
msgid "Do not show"
msgstr "Nezobrazovať"

msgctxt "#30501"
msgid "Audio languages"
msgstr "Jazyky zvuku"

msgctxt "#30502"
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Veľkosť"

msgctxt "#30503"
msgid "Resolution and codec"
msgstr "Rozlíšenie a kodek"

msgctxt "#30504"
msgid "Audio tracks"
msgstr "Zvukové stopy"

msgctxt "#30505"
msgid "Bitrate"
msgstr "Dátový tok"

msgctxt "#30506"
msgid "Length"
msgstr "Dĺžka"

msgctxt "#30507"
msgid "Subtitles"
msgstr "Titulky"

msgctxt "#30508"
msgid "Source"
msgstr "Zdroj"

msgctxt "#30509"
msgid "File name"
msgstr "Názov súboru"

msgctxt "#30510"
msgid "Up"
msgstr "Hore"

msgctxt "#30511"
msgid "Down"
msgstr "Dole"

msgctxt "#30512"
msgid "Stream details reset to the default order"
msgstr "Poradie údajov pri streame vrátené na predvolené"

msgctxt "#30513"
msgid "Choose stream"
msgstr "Vybrať stream"

msgctxt "#30514"
msgid "Use the arrows to move details between the top and bottom line of the stream dialog; move what should not be shown into Do not show. Quality is always the picture on the left."
msgstr "Šípkami presuň údaje medzi horným a dolným riadkom dialógu výberu streamu, do Nezobrazovať presuň, čo sa nemá ukazovať. Kvalita je vždy obrázok vľavo."

msgctxt "#30515"
msgid "On the phone the details move with arrows between the top and bottom line. That is easier than typing the order here."
msgstr "V mobile sa dajú údaje presúvať šípkami medzi horným a dolným riadkom. Je to pohodlnejšie než písať poradie ručne."

msgctxt "#30516"
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Vymazať"

msgctxt "#30517"
msgid "OK opens the address in a browser"
msgstr "OK adresu otvorí v prehliadači"

msgctxt "#30518"
msgid "Opening in browser…"
msgstr "Otváram v prehliadači…"

msgctxt "#30520"
msgid "Luna %s responds and returns streams. The setup is fine."
msgstr "Luna %s odpovedá a vracia streamy. Nastavenie je v poriadku."

msgctxt "#30521"
msgid "Neither the Luna address nor the token is filled in.[CR]Use “Find Luna on the network”, or paste the whole add-on address from Luna's /setup page into the Token field."
msgstr "Nie je vyplnená adresa Luny ani token.[CR]Použi „Nájsť Lunu v sieti“, alebo vlož do poľa Token celú adresu doplnku zo stránky /setup Luny."

msgctxt "#30522"
msgid "The address %s is not in the expected format.[CR]Expected something like 192.168.1.10:7126."
msgstr "Adresa %s nemá očakávaný tvar.[CR]Očakáva sa napríklad 192.168.1.10:7126."

msgctxt "#30523"
msgid "Nobody answered at %s.[CR][CR]Is the computer running Luna switched on? Is it on the same network as this device? Try “Find Luna on the network”."
msgstr "Na adrese %s sa nikto neozval.[CR][CR]Beží počítač, kde je Luna spustená? Je v rovnakej sieti ako toto zariadenie? Skús „Nájsť Lunu v sieti“."

msgctxt "#30524"
msgid "Something answers at %s, but it is not Luna.[CR]Check the port — Luna uses 7126 by default."
msgstr "Na adrese %s niečo odpovedá, ale nie je to Luna.[CR]Skontroluj port — Luna má predvolený 7126."

msgctxt "#30525"
msgid "Luna %s is running, but the token is missing.[CR][CR]Open %s/setup in a browser, copy the add-on address and paste the whole thing into the Token field — the add-on will pull both the address and the token out of it."
msgstr "Luna %s beží, ale chýba token.[CR][CR]Otvor v prehliadači %s/setup, skopíruj adresu doplnku a vlož ju celú do poľa Token — adresu aj token si z nej doplnok vytiahne sám."

msgctxt "#30526"
msgid "What is in the Token field is not a token.[CR][CR]A token starts with “e1.” and is long. Open %s/setup and copy the whole add-on address."
msgstr "V poli Token nie je token.[CR][CR]Token začína „e1.“ a je dlhý. Otvor %s/setup a skopíruj celú adresu doplnku."

msgctxt "#30527"
msgid "Luna %s is running, but it did not accept this token.[CR][CR]Generate the add-on address again at %s/setup and paste the whole thing into the Token field."
msgstr "Luna %s beží, ale tento token neprijala.[CR][CR]Vygeneruj si adresu doplnku znova na %s/setup a vlož ju celú do poľa Token."

msgctxt "#30528"
msgid "Luna %s answers and the WebShare search works, but its main source returns nothing.[CR][CR]Check the WebShare account at %s/setup and whether the token really comes from this Luna."
msgstr "Luna %s odpovedá a hľadanie na WebShare funguje, ale jej hlavný zdroj nič nevracia.[CR][CR]Skontroluj na %s/setup účet WebShare a či je token naozaj z tejto Luny."

msgctxt "#30529"
msgid "Luna %s is running, but it found no streams even for well-known films.[CR][CR]Usually the WebShare account is missing in Luna itself — open %s/setup and fill it in."
msgstr "Luna %s beží, ale nenašla streamy ani pri známych filmoch.[CR][CR]Najčastejšie chýba účet WebShare v samotnej Lune — otvor %s/setup a doplň ho."

msgctxt "#30530"
msgid "Looking for Luna on the local network…"
msgstr "Hľadám Lunu v miestnej sieti…"

msgctxt "#30531"
msgid "Luna was not found on this network.[CR][CR]Is it running on some computer at home? Does it use the default port 7126? If it runs elsewhere or on another port, fill the address in by hand."
msgstr "V tejto sieti sa Luna nenašla.[CR][CR]Beží na niektorom počítači v domácnosti? Má predvolený port 7126? Ak beží inde alebo na inom porte, vyplň adresu ručne."

msgctxt "#30532"
msgid "Luna servers found"
msgstr "Nájdené servery Luny"

msgctxt "#30533"
msgid "Checking Luna…"
msgstr "Overujem Lunu…"

msgctxt "#30534"
msgid "Luna check"
msgstr "Overenie Luny"


msgctxt "#30536"
msgid "Send log"
msgstr "Poslať log"

msgctxt "#30537"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Zavrieť"

msgctxt "#30538"
msgid "Find Luna on the network"
msgstr "Nájsť Lunu v sieti"

msgctxt "#30539"
msgid "Check Luna setup"
msgstr "Overiť nastavenie Luny"

msgctxt "#30540"
msgid "Goes through your home network and fills in the address where Luna is running. It only takes a few seconds."
msgstr "Prejde domácu sieť a vyplní adresu, kde Luna beží. Trvá to pár sekúnd."

msgctxt "#30541"
msgid "Says exactly what is wrong: whether the server answers, whether the token is valid and whether any streams come back."
msgstr "Povie, čo presne nesedí: či server odpovedá, či platí token a či chodia streamy."

msgctxt "#30542"
msgid "Paste the add-on address from %s/setup"
msgstr "Vlož adresu doplnku z %s/setup"

msgctxt "#30543"
msgid "address and token are both missing"
msgstr "chýba adresa aj token"

msgctxt "#30544"
msgid "the address makes no sense"
msgstr "adresa nedáva zmysel"

msgctxt "#30545"
msgid "the server does not answer"
msgstr "server neodpovedá"

msgctxt "#30546"
msgid "Luna is not running at that address"
msgstr "na tej adrese nebeží Luna"

msgctxt "#30547"
msgid "running, but the token is missing"
msgstr "beží, ale chýba token"

msgctxt "#30548"
msgid "what is in the Token field is not a token"
msgstr "v poli Token nie je token"

msgctxt "#30549"
msgid "Luna did not accept the token"
msgstr "token Luna neprijala"

msgctxt "#30550"
msgid "the main source returns nothing — WebShare account in Luna?"
msgstr "hlavný zdroj nič nevracia — účet WebShare v Lune?"

msgctxt "#30551"
msgid "no streams found — WebShare account in Luna?"
msgstr "nenašla žiadne streamy — účet WebShare v Lune?"

msgctxt "#30552"
msgid "All good"
msgstr "V poriadku"

msgctxt "#30553"
msgid "Careful"
msgstr "Pozor"

msgctxt "#30554"
msgid "Did not work"
msgstr "Nepodarilo sa"

msgctxt "#30555"
msgid "Enter address"
msgstr "Zadať adresu"

msgctxt "#30556"
msgid "Luna address (or the whole add-on address from /setup)"
msgstr "Adresa Luny (alebo celá adresa doplnku zo /setup)"

msgctxt "#30557"
msgid "The saved setup is what gets checked — a value typed into the field counts only after OK. A different address can be entered right here."
msgstr "Overuje sa uložené nastavenie — hodnota rozpísaná v políčku sa započíta až po OK. Inú adresu je možné zadať rovno tu."

msgctxt "#30558"
msgid "Show all streams"
msgstr "Zobraziť všetky streamy"

msgctxt "#30559"
msgid "Hungarian"
msgstr "Maďarčina"

msgctxt "#30560"
msgid "CZtor"
msgstr "CZtor"

msgctxt "#30561"
msgid "Enable CZtor"
msgstr "Zapnúť CZtor"

msgctxt "#30562"
msgid "CZtor catalogue with a subscription (cztor.com, storage at giganthost.com). The device is paired with a PIN — the account password is never entered into the add-on."
msgstr "Katalóg CZtor s predplatným (cztor.com, úložisko giganthost.com). Zariadenie sa spáruje PIN kódom — heslo účtu sa do doplnku nezadáva."

msgctxt "#30563"
msgid "Pair with PIN"
msgstr "Spárovať PIN kódom"

msgctxt "#30564"
msgid "Open cztor.com/activate on your phone or computer, log in and enter the PIN shown here."
msgstr "Na telefóne alebo počítači otvor cztor.com/activate, prihlás sa a zadaj PIN, ktorý sa tu zobrazí."

msgctxt "#30565"
msgid "Unpair this device"
msgstr "Odhlásiť toto zariadenie"

msgctxt "#30566"
msgid "Account status"
msgstr "Stav účtu"

msgctxt "#30567"
msgid "On your phone or computer open[CR][B]%s[/B][CR]log in and enter PIN [B]%s[/B]"
msgstr "Na telefóne alebo počítači otvor[CR][B]%s[/B][CR]prihlás sa a zadaj PIN [B]%s[/B]"

msgctxt "#30568"
msgid "CZtor: %s, plan %s until %s"
msgstr "CZtor: %s, predplatné %s do %s"

msgctxt "#30569"
msgid "Pairing with CZtor failed."
msgstr "Spárovanie s CZtor sa nepodarilo."

msgctxt "#30570"
msgid "CZtor unpaired."
msgstr "CZtor odhlásený."

msgctxt "#30571"
msgid "CZtor is not paired — use Pair with PIN."
msgstr "CZtor nie je spárovaný — použi Spárovať PIN kódom."

msgctxt "#30572"
msgid "CZtor subscription is not active."
msgstr "Predplatné CZtor nie je aktívne."

msgctxt "#30573"
msgid "Do you have a CZtor subscription (cztor.com)?[CR]The device is paired with a PIN, no password needed."
msgstr "Máš predplatné CZtor (cztor.com)?[CR]Zariadenie sa spáruje PIN kódom, heslo netreba."

msgctxt "#30574"
msgid "How to set up Luna"
msgstr "Ako nastaviť Lunu"

msgctxt "#30575"
msgid "1. Luna runs on a computer or server at home (the Home Assistant add-on, port 7126).[CR]2. Tap Find Luna on the network - the address fills in by itself.[CR]3. Open the Luna address plus /setup in a browser, copy the add-on address and paste all of it into the Token field - the add-on takes the address and the token from it.[CR]4. Tap Check Luna setup. When it says all is well, tap Save to Kodi at the bottom."
msgstr "1. Luna beží na počítači alebo serveri doma (doplnok pre Home Assistant, port 7126).[CR]2. Klepni na Nájsť Lunu v sieti — adresa sa vyplní sama.[CR]3. V prehliadači otvor adresu Luny s /setup na konci, skopíruj adresu doplnku a vlož ju celú do poľa Token — adresu aj token z nej doplnok vytiahne sám.[CR]4. Klepni na Overiť nastavenie Luny. Keď napíše, že je všetko v poriadku, dole klepni na Uložiť do Kodi."

msgctxt "#30576"
msgid "Luna found: %s[CR]Tap Save to Kodi at the bottom to keep the address."
msgstr "Luna nájdená: %s[CR]Adresu uložíš tlačidlom Uložiť do Kodi dole."

msgctxt "#30577"
msgid "No stream found"
msgstr "Žiadny stream nenájdený"

msgctxt "#30578"
msgid "Try searching under a different name?[CR]The name you type is searched as full text in the sources (for an episode the season and episode number is added)."
msgstr "Skúsiť hľadať pod iným názvom?[CR]Zadaný názov sa hľadá fulltextom v zdrojoch (pri diele seriálu sa pridá číslo série a dielu)."

msgctxt "#30579"
msgid "Name to search for"
msgstr "Názov na hľadanie"

msgctxt "#30580"
msgid "Connection to the TV was lost - start Set up from mobile on the TV again."
msgstr "Spojenie s televízorom sa prerušilo — na TV spusti Nastaviť z mobilu znova."

msgctxt "#30581"
msgid "Open Luna settings (/setup)"
msgstr "Otvoriť nastavenia Luny (/setup)"

msgctxt "#30582"
msgid "TV program: show programmes that already ended today"
msgstr "TV program: ukázať aj dnes už skončené relácie"

msgctxt "#30583"
msgid "Today's TV programme normally hides programmes that have already ended. Turn on to show the whole day."
msgstr "Dnešný TV program bežne skrýva relácie, ktoré už skončili. Zapnuté ukáže celý deň."

msgctxt "#30584"
msgid "Finished programmes"
msgstr "Skončené relácie"

msgctxt "#30585"
msgid "shown"
msgstr "ukázané"

msgctxt "#30586"
msgid "hidden"
msgstr "skryté"

msgctxt "#30587"
msgid "Transfer settings"
msgstr "Prenos nastavenia"

msgctxt "#30588"
msgid "Copies accounts and options to another Kodi. CZtor and Trakt accounts stay behind — sign in again on the new device."
msgstr "Prenesie účty a voľby do ďalšieho Kodi. Účty CZtoru a Traktu zostanú — na novom zariadení sa prihlás znova."

msgctxt "#30589"
msgid "Send to another Kodi"
msgstr "Odoslať do iného Kodi"

msgctxt "#30590"
msgid "Load from another Kodi"
msgstr "Načítať z iného Kodi"

msgctxt "#30591"
msgid "Save to a file"
msgstr "Uložiť do súboru"

msgctxt "#30592"
msgid "Load from a file"
msgstr "Načítať zo súboru"

msgctxt "#30593"
msgid "On the other Kodi open Settings – Transfer settings – Load from another Kodi and type this code:[CR][CR][B]%s[/B][CR][CR]It works once and expires in %s minutes."
msgstr "Na druhom Kodi otvor Nastavenia – Prenos nastavení – Načítať z iného Kodi a zadaj tento kód:[CR][CR][B]%s[/B][CR][CR]Použije sa raz a platí %s minút."

msgctxt "#30594"
msgid "Code from the other Kodi"
msgstr "Kód z druhého Kodi"

msgctxt "#30595"
msgid "Transfer failed: %s"
msgstr "Prenos sa nepodaril: %s"

msgctxt "#30596"
msgid "%s settings will be written, from %s.[CR]Already the same: %s · not used here: %s[CR][CR]Current settings will be overwritten. A copy stays in %s."
msgstr "Zapíše sa %s nastavení z %s.[CR]Zhodné: %s · nepoužije sa: %s[CR][CR]Terajšie nastavenie sa prepíše. Kópia zostane v %s."

msgctxt "#30597"
msgid "Settings transferred (%s)"
msgstr "Nastavenie prenesené (%s)"

msgctxt "#30598"
msgid "Nothing to change — the other device has the same settings."
msgstr "Z prenosu neprišla žiadna zmena."

msgctxt "#30599"
msgid "Saved to %s[CR][CR]Code for loading it:[CR][B]%s[/B][CR][CR]Without the code nobody can read the file."
msgstr "Uložené do %s[CR][CR]Kód na načítanie:[CR][B]%s[/B][CR][CR]Bez kódu súbor nikto neprečíta."

msgctxt "#30600"
msgid "The CZtor account is not transferred. Pair now?"
msgstr "Účet CZtoru sa neprenáša. Spárovať teraz?"

msgctxt "#30601"
msgid "The Trakt account is not transferred. Sign in now?"
msgstr "Účet Traktu sa neprenáša. Prihlásiť teraz?"

msgctxt "#30603"
msgid "The file could not be written: %s"
msgstr "Súbor sa nepodarilo zapísať: %s"

msgctxt "#30604"
msgid "The file could not be read: %s"
msgstr "Súbor sa nepodarilo prečítať: %s"

msgctxt "#30605"
msgid "For You"
msgstr "Pre Teba"

msgctxt "#30606"
msgid "Because you watched %s"
msgstr "Pretože si videl: %s"

msgctxt "#30607"
msgid "No recommendations yet — they are built from recently watched titles."
msgstr "Zatiaľ nie je z čoho odporúčať — zoznam vzniká z naposledy pozretých titulov."

msgctxt "#30608"
